ocation: Ikut nisbah modal 40:60\",\"Management rights: FELDA sebagai rakan pengurus\",\"Exit mechanism: Musharakah mutanaqisah 4 tahun\"]},{\"title\":\"Approved Clauses\",\"number\":\"4\",\"paragraphs\":[\"[UJIAN] Pembahagian kerugian: Kerugian ditanggung oleh rakan kongsi mengikut nisbah sumbangan modal masing-masing. Reference: AAOIFI SS 12.\"]},{\"title\":\"Shariah Conditions and Compliance\",\"number\":\"5\",\"paragraphs\":[\"[UJIAN] Rugi ikut modal: Kerugian mesti dibahagi mengikut nisbah modal, bukan nisbah untung.\"]},{\"title\":\"AI-Assisted Drafting Note\",\"number\":\"6\",\"paragraphs\":[\"This agreement was assembled from the wizard facts and approved clauses.\"]},{\"title\":\"Schedules\",\"number\":\"7\",\"paragraphs\":[\"Schedule 1 - Commercial Inputs:\",\"Project type: Agriculture\",\"Partners: FELDA Holdings; Pelabur Pool B\",\"Contributions: FELDA RM1,000,000; Pelabur RM1,500,000\",\"Profit sharing: 55:45\",\"Loss allocation: Ikut nisbah modal 40:60\",\"Management rights: FELDA sebagai rakan pengurus\",\"Exit mechanism: Musharakah mutanaqisah 4 tahun\",\"Schedule 2 - Approved Shariah References and Clause Sources.\"]},{\"title\":\"Signatures\",\"number\":\"8\",\"paragraphs\":[\"For and on behalf of the relevant parties:\",\"Name: ____________________    Title: ____________________    Date: __________\",\"Signature: ______________________________________________________________\"]}],\"variables\":{\"{{LESSEE_NAME}}\":\"[LESSEE_NAME]\",\"{{LESSOR_NAME}}\":\"[LESSOR_NAME]\",\"{{PROFIT_RATIO}}\":\"55:45\",\"{{PROJECT_NAME}}\":\"[PROJECT_NAME]\",\"{{CAPITAL_AMOUNT}}\":\"[CAPITAL_AMOUNT]\",\"{{ASSET_DESCRIPTION}}\":\"[ASSET_DESCRIPTION]\"},\"shariahRuleIds\":[\"cmuzbqttg0005pjko1y0yfvf0\"],\"aiSkippedReason\":\"Insufficient AI Credits. Please upgrade plan or purchase credits.\",\"approvedClauseIds\":[\"cmuzbqtqy0001pjkoubk5xsp6\"]},\"status\":\"DRAFT\",\"createdBy\":\"USR-AHMAD-PDP\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-10-08T09:31:14.725Z\"}],\"parties\":[],\"approvals\